{"id":120189115846709,"name":"TTK Testing [CUSTOMIZATION]","desc":"Think someone’s cheating? Try the new ingame report system in testing. We can reconstruct and view, in 3D realtime, any game history to see if someone was exploiting.\n\nTHE XP/IC ECONOMY IS SUBJECT TO WIPES!\nWEEKLY UPDATES, AND EVEN DAILY UPDATES SOMETIMES. The game is constantly growing, so these are usually pretty serious updates rather than maintenance.\n\nWinner of Innovation in Tech at the 2026 Innovation Awards!\n\nPress P to go into Helmetcam!\nWant better visibility through optics? Try \"Transparent Optics\" in Settings to simulate both eyes open!\n\nPC, mobile, Xbox, PS5, we're focusing on maximum compatibility right out of the gate.\n\n<<This game is intended for co-op PVE squad AI mechanics, storybased doorkicker scenarios/missions, and team-based PVP modes.>\n\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/ttk-our-very-early-tactical-fps/4664539\n\nControls\nFire: M1\nAim: M2\nCrouch: C\nLean left / right: Q / E\nSwap weapon: Number\n\nLEAD DEVS: PoptartNoahh, CanyonJack","path":"/game/120189115846709-ttk-testing-customization","slug":"120189115846709-ttk-testing-customization","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/40b9b8f577711c318ab61f331fd0f768c424f94a2de84bd46002cd6c93b7bb1c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bf089cf001cab0f078be310d2331f049/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3118,"visitor":59111114,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-08T15:00:54.728Z","creator":{"name":"Sable Digital","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":22,"freeCount":20,"keyCount":5,"verifiedCount":4},"page":2,"next":null,"total":2,"scripts":[{"slug":"TTK-Testing-M18-3-MILLION-Bullet-TP-237097","_id":"6a305fcdf09c56c11df13ba4","title":"Bullet TP","game":{"_id":"6a21e496f0c40fdd4b20ad40","gameId":120189115846709,"name":"TTK Testing [CUSTOMIZATION]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":120189115846709},"features":"If you abuse with Rapid aim, you will be detected and removed from the game. This is likely based on the interval between kills","tags":["silent aim","kill all","ttk"],"script":"--!native\n-- depso\n\nconst Players = cloneref(game:GetService(\"Players\"))\n\nlocal Index = 0\nconst function GetJitsHead(): (Vector3?, Vector3?)\n\tconst PlayersArray = Players:GetPlayers()\n\tIndex = (Index + 1) % #PlayersArray \n\n\tconst Jit = PlayersArray[Index + 1]\n\tconst Character = Jit.Character\n\tif not Character then return end\n\n\tconst Position = Character:GetPivot().Position\n\tconst Offset = Vector3.new(0, 0, 2)\n\n\treturn Position + Offset, Offset * -1\nend\n\nconst function SpoofDischarge(Function)\n\tlocal Previous; Previous = hookfunction(Function, newcclosure(function(self, GunName, EyePosition, FireDirection, MuzzleWorldPosition, ...)\n\t\tconst FromOverride, DirOverride = GetJitsHead()\n\t\tif FromOverride then\n\t\t\tMuzzleWorldPosition = FromOverride\n\t\t\tEyePosition = FromOverride\n\t\t\tFireDirection = DirOverride\n\t\tend\n\t\t\n\t\treturn Previous(self, GunName, EyePosition, FireDirection, MuzzleWorldPosition, ...)\n\tend))\nend\n\nfor _, Jit in next, getgc(true) do\n\tif typeof(Jit) ~= \"table\" then continue end\n\n\t--// Bullet handler\n\tif rawget(Jit, \"Discharge\") then\n\t\tSpoofDischarge(rawget(Jit, \"Discharge\"))\n\tend\nend","owner":{"_id":"682d7e6cb9ed364b3a0bda05","username":"depso","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1b35ef0065f63de7752aeed1639eb42485a1fab66658499cbc66da439d7aecd6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/682d7e6cb9ed364b3a0bda05-1775164584479.jpg"},"lvl":9,"status":"offline","id":"682d7e6cb9ed364b3a0bda05","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":100},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1b35ef0065f63de7752aeed1639eb42485a1fab66658499cbc66da439d7aecd6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/682d7e6cb9ed364b3